# Context lean

- Unknown area: `graphify query "..." --budget 800` before broad greps. One node: `graphify explain "..." --budget 800`. Between two: `graphify path "A" "B" --budget 800`. What a change breaks: `graphify affected "..." --budget 800`. `graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md` only for whole-architecture questions. Never open `graph.json`/`graph.html` or diff `graphify-out/`.
- Grep/glob first, then read only the files you will touch. Never re-read unchanged files or re-list the tree.
- Reference paths instead of pasting file contents. Keep only failing lines of command output.
- Verify with the smallest check that proves the change. Reuse existing helpers instead of near-duplicates.
- Terse replies: no filler, hedging, repeated diffs or restating the plan. Keep code, paths and errors exact.
